  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP Local Area Develoment Programme Iraq, 2012-14</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNDP Local Area Develoment Programme Iraq, 2012-14</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Huvudm&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka lokal samh&#xe4;lsstyrning p&#xe5; provins- och distriktsniv&#xe5; med s&#xe4;rskilt avseende p&#xe5; planering och social service.  Programmet skulle ursprungligen samfinansieras med EU, EU-finansieringen starkt f&#xf6;rsenad, programmet d&#xe4;rmed mer av pilotkarakt&#xe4;r hittills, mestadels implementerat i Kurdiska Irak i syfte att skapa modeller att replikera i landet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Main objective is to support local democratic governance at province and district level. Originally the EU was supposed to be the main funder, but the process is delayed. So far, the program has been more of a pilot project with main activities in the Kurdish region to provide a model for upscaling.</narrative>
  </description>
